1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,680
M: I was just reading over the sales report and realized that our numbers have taken quite a dip compared to this time last year.

2
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,760
What do you think the problem is?

3
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:16,780
W: Well, there are several reasons, but one of the main reasons is that we have lost some of our main players to our competitors.

4
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:22,200
I brought the issue up at our last meeting, but no one really thought that it was all that important.

5
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:28,980
I, on the other hand, feel that we really need to focus our attention on keeping those talented people here.

6
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:33,160
M: In your opinion, what is the main reason people are leaving us?

7
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,160
W: It's obvious.

8
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:37,440
We need to compensate them with higher pay and benefits.
